{"id":"n58881-1-18","stage":1,"title":"변하다 · 变","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58881-1-18-1","ko":"오전까지 하늘이 맑더니 갑자기 검게 변하는데요?","zh":"早上天还很晴朗，突然就变黑了啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오전까지","meaning":"上午","explanation":"오전：上午；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"오전","audio":"/audio/1087feb238ccd11091f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20246","senseId":"1","lemma":"오전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하늘이","meaning":"天空","explanation":"하늘：天空；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"하늘","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20311","senseId":"1","lemma":"하늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맑더니","meaning":"晴朗，明朗","explanation":"맑다：晴朗，明朗；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"맑다","audio":"/audio/c8398a865a7478831698.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66031","senseId":"2","lemma":"맑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"검게","meaning":"黑","explanation":"검다：黑；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"검다","audio":"/audio/a665a697a61a0146eafb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62259","senseId":"1","lemma":"검다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"변하는데요?","meaning":"变，改变，变成","explanation":"변하다：变，改变，变成；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"변하다","audio":"/audio/35e71a5db7e3493cf6ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58881","senseId":"1","lemma":"변하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1087feb238ccd110","term":"오전","zh":"上午","audio":"/audio/1087feb238ccd11091f9.mp3","entryId":"20246","definition":"从早晨到中午十二点期间。","pronunciation":["오ː전"]},{"id":"4cd0df8d103d3a7b","term":"하늘","zh":"天空","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3","entryId":"20311","definition":"地面上无限伸展的空间。","pronunciation":["하늘"]},{"id":"c8398a865a747883","term":"맑다","zh":"晴朗，明朗","audio":"/audio/c8398a865a7478831698.mp3","entryId":"66031","definition":"没有云雾，天气很好。","pronunciation":["막따"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"a665a697a61a0146","term":"검다","zh":"黑","audio":"/audio/a665a697a61a0146eafb.mp3","entryId":"62259","definition":"颜色和没有光线的夜空一样又暗又浓。","pronunciation":["검ː따"]},{"id":"35e71a5db7e3493c","term":"변하다","zh":"变，改变，变成","audio":"/audio/35e71a5db7e3493cf6ff.mp3","entryId":"58881","definition":"成为其他东西或性质发生变动。","pronunciation":["변ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e4ec2c723bfee18de098.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58881-1-18-2","ko":"정말 그러네요. 소나기가 오려나 봐요.","zh":"确实是这样呢，看来要下阵雨了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그러네요.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소나기가","meaning":"雷阵雨","explanation":"소나기：雷阵雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소나기","audio":"/audio/fae7e38885116b20898a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63524","senseId":"1","lemma":"소나기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오려나","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；려나：表示对未来情况的疑问或推测。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐요.","meaning":"看样子，看来","explanation":"보다：看样子，看来；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"fae7e38885116b20","term":"소나기","zh":"雷阵雨","audio":"/audio/fae7e38885116b20898a.mp3","entryId":"63524","definition":"突然下得很大、又很快停的雨。","pronunciation":["소나기"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看样子，看来","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"由前面的话语所指的行动或状态来推算或表示即使不正确但知道。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/064b7efd799d44918b9b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.715,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58881","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":48,"sequenceScore":2.1155,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["确实是这样呢，看来要下阵雨了。","我们家孩子对学习没兴趣，真是麻烦大了。","早上天还很晴朗，突然就变黑了啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["确实是这样呢，看来要下阵雨了。","早上天还很晴朗，突然就变黑了啊？","我们家孩子对学习没兴趣，真是麻烦大了。"],"answer":0}]}
